></svg></mjx-container> and the slope is zero at the same point.</p>\n<p>Find the derivative: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.296ex\" height=\"2.283ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -759 6760.9 1009\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(636,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(880.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1269.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1841.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2508.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3564,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(4085,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(499,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5260.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(6260.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Set <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.195ex\" height=\"2.283ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -759 4064 1009\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(636,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(880.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1269.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1841.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2508.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3564,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> to find the minimum or maximum point: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.381ex\" height=\"1.756ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 5030.5 776\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(521,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(499,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1696.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2696.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3474.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4530.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. This gives <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.466ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.896ex\" height=\"2.036ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 4815.9 900\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(849.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1905.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2850.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\"></use><use data-c=\"6F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6F\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"67\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-67\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4128.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4294.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Now check the second derivative: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" j